### Achievement Management API Tests

### 1. Get All Achievements (Public - No Auth Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements
Content-Type: application/json

### 2. Get Achievement Statistics (Public - No Auth Required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/stats
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Get Achievement by ID (Requires Authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 4. Get User Achievements (Requires Authentication)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/user/{{userId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 5. Create Achievement with Certificate File (Requires CreateAchievement permission)
# IMPORTANT: Use "file" as the field name for the file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Excellence in Leadership
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Demonstrated exceptional leadership skills during the annual project
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="achievementType"

best_member_of_the_month
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

{{userId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="badgeIcon"

https://example.com/badges/leadership.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="certificate.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/certificate.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 5.1. Create Achievement with Photo (Requires CreateAchievement permission)
# IMPORTANT: Use "file" as the field name for the file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="title"

Excellence in Leadership
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Demonstrated exceptional leadership skills during the annual project
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="achievementType"

best_member_of_the_month
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="userId"

{{userId}}
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="badgeIcon"

https://example.com/badges/leadership.png
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="achievement_photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/achievement_photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 6. Create Achievement without File (Requires CreateAchievement permission)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Excellence in Leadership",
  "description": "Demonstrated exceptional leadership skills during the annual project",
  "achievementType": "best_member_of_the_month",
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "badgeIcon": "https://example.com/badges/leadership.png"
}

### 7. Update Achievement (Requires EditAchievement permission)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

{
  "title": "Updated Excellence in Leadership",
  "description": "Updated description for the leadership achievement",
  "achievementType": "best_member_of_the_month",
  "badgeIcon": "https://example.com/badges/leadership-updated.png"
}

### 8. Delete Achievement (Requires DeleteAchievement permission)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 9. Upload Supporting Document to Achievement (Requires EditAchievement permission)
# IMPORTANT: Use "file" as the field name for the file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}/supporting-document
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Project proposal document that led to this achievement
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="proposal.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./path/to/proposal.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 9.1. Upload Supporting Photo to Achievement (Requires EditAchievement permission)
# IMPORTANT: Use "file" as the field name for the file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}/supporting-document
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="description"

Photo from the project presentation
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="presentation_photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/presentation_photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 9.2. Upload Achievement Photo (Requires EditAchievement permission)
# IMPORTANT: Use "file" as the field name for the file upload
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}/photo
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="achievement_photo.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./path/to/achievement_photo.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

### 10. Remove Supporting Document from Achievement (Requires EditAchievement permission)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}/file/supporting/0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11. Remove Certificate File from Achievement (Requires EditAchievement permission)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}/file/certificate/0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 11.1. Remove Achievement Photo from Achievement (Requires EditAchievement permission)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/{{achievementId}}/file/photo/0
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 12. Get Achievements with Filtering and Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements?page=1&limit=5&type=best_member_of_the_month&sort=-dateAwarded&search=leadership
Content-Type: application/json

### 13. Get User Achievements with Filtering and Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/achievements/user/{{userId}}?page=1&limit=10&sort=-dateAwarded
Content-Type: application/json

### Variables (set these in your environment or at the top of the file)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4005
@authToken = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..FfnxFSLKSchT5hAZ1Bi-BG97K4_mMsyW7OBa4tlaHv8
